  "body": "Positioned in a quiet, peaceful position in one of Glendowie's most sought-after crescents, this expansive family residence features a wonderful, seamless flow that delivers the ultimate combination of space, style, and coastal living.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights:\r\n\r\n* Generous Accommodation: Four spacious bedrooms, complemented by a large dedicated study-ideal for working from home or a teenage retreat (staged as a bedroom on the lower level)\r\n* Versatile Living: Two distinct living areas providing ample room for family relaxation and entertaining, downstairs complete with a convenient kitchenette.\r\n* Breathtaking Views: Enjoy serene water views across Tahuna Torea and out to the Hauraki Gulf from the lounge, kitchen, dining area, and the sunny elevated balcony.\r\n* Outdoor Potential: Wonderful indoor-outdoor flow, with ample backyard space offering exciting potential for a pool.\r\n* Exceptional Parking: Plenty of secure off-street parking for all the \"toys\"- boats, jet skis, or extra vehicles.\r\n* School Zones & Education: Zoned for Glendowie Primary and Glendowie College, with Sacred Heart College also within easy walking distance.\r\n* Offering heaps of internal space and a lifestyle of absolute convenience close to local reserves, beaches, and amenities, this is a rare opportunity to secure a premier property in a tightly held neighbourhood.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange a viewing!",
